# Words of the talent tooltips and detail panel. The server prefixes every
# key with the file name: "stat.Health" is looked up as "talentgraph.stat.Health".
# A pack may ship this file in another language under Server/Languages/<lang>/,
# and translate its own ids under stat.<Id>, effect.<Id>, ability.<Id>,
# tag.<Key>.<Value> (a tag "Family=Sword" is the key "tag.Family.Sword").

